    {
      "id": "the-witcher-3-wild-hunt:kaer-morhen:154013:632",
      "name": "The Final Trial",
      "slug": "154013",
      "typeSlug": "632",
      "iconSlug": "main_quest",
      "lat": 83.90482,
      "lng": -168.02756,
      "wikiPage": "Ugly_Baby",
      "checklistTaskId": 64529713,
      "mapgenieId": 154013,
      "regionId": null,
      "description": "Next | Previous Level: 19 _The task of preparing the phylactery fell to Lambert, to his great dissatisfaction. His discontent came as no surprise to me when I learned of it - Lambert was not the most obliging of fellows, and Yennefer, well, let us just say she was not his favorite individual. Nevertheless, Lambert agreed to do the job, and Geralt felt he had no choice but to accompany him._ Rewards: - XP",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "id": "the-witcher-3-wild-hunt:kaer-morhen:154019:632",
      "name": "The Isle of Mists",
      "slug": "154019",
      "typeSlug": "632",
      "iconSlug": "main_quest",
      "lat": 83.90482,
      "lng": -168.01733,
      "wikiPage": null,
      "checklistTaskId": 64859899,
      "mapgenieId": 154019,
      "regionId": null,
      "description": "Next | Previous Level: 22 _After a long search Geralt was at last a step from his goal. Avallac'h had hid Ciri from the Hunt on the magical Isle of Mists, which could only be reached if fate deemed one worthy - or by following a magic firefly, which was decidedly the easier option. Geralt thus readied himself to sail to the isle and bring back Ciri._ Rewards: - XP",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "id": "the-witcher-3-wild-hunt:kaer-morhen:22381:632",
      "name": "To Bait a Forktail...",
      "slug": "22381",
      "typeSlug": "632",
      "iconSlug": "main_quest",
      "lat": 83.9032,
      "lng": -168.07556,
      "wikiPage": null,
      "checklistTaskId": 64529712,
      "mapgenieId": 22381,
      "regionId": null,
      "description": "Next | Previous Level: 19 _Yennefer asked - or rather, if I am to be completely honest with you, dear reader, ordered - Geralt to help Eskel hunt a forktail. The sorceress needed ingredients from this dangerous beast's body and clearly thought two witchers would get the job done sooner than one. Geralt thus set out to track the monster - but first, he had to find Eskel._ Rewards: - ??",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "id": "the-witcher-3-wild-hunt:kaer-morhen:555846:632",
      "name": "Disturbance",
      "slug": "555846",
      "typeSlug": "632",
      "iconSlug": "main_quest",
      "lat": 83.90482,
      "lng": -168.03098,
      "wikiPage": "Ugly_Baby",
      "checklistTaskId": 65194567,
      "mapgenieId": 555846,
      "regionId": null,
      "description": "Next | Previous Level: 19 _Vesemir told Geralt that Yennefer had set up her trusty megascope as soon as she arrived at Kaer Morhen, but could not get it to function for the life of her. This news greatly troubled the witcher. If Yennefer was planning to use her megascope, that meant a conversation with other sorceresses was in the works – and that in turn meant scheming, politics and other things Geralt truly could not stand._ Rewards: - XP",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "id": "the-witcher-3-wild-hunt:kaer-morhen:555847:632",
      "name": "No Place Like Home",
      "slug": "555847",
      "typeSlug": "632",
      "iconSlug": "main_quest",
      "lat": 83.90482,
      "lng": -168.02415,
      "wikiPage": "Ugly_Baby",
      "checklistTaskId": 65194568,
      "mapgenieId": 555847,
      "regionId": null,
      "description": "Next | Previous Level: 19 _Once Geralt had helped both Lambert and Eskel, Yennefer was ready to lift Uma's curse. Yet in a surprise twist, Vesemir demanded they wait. The old witcher wanted to try his own, less risky method before the sorceress went about her invasive business. The others all bowed to his seniority and wisdom and let him take Uma to treat as he wished - leaving them with an unexpectedly free evening to fill. Eskel timidly suggested they spend this time productively, but this suggestion lost out to a more attractive alternative - a night of drink and camaraderie._ Rewards: - XP",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "id": "the-witcher-3-wild-hunt:kaer-morhen:555848:632",
      "name": "Va Fail, Elaine",
      "slug": "555848",
      "typeSlug": "632",
      "iconSlug": "main_quest",
      "lat": 83.90482,
      "lng": -168.02074,
      "wikiPage": null,
      "checklistTaskId": 65194569,
      "mapgenieId": 555848,
      "regionId": null,
      "description": "Next | Previous Level: 19 _Traveling via Geralt's most beloved means of transport, teleportation, Yennefer reached Kaer Morhen first - and immediately started bossing everyone around. Not only did she divvy out chores to the witchers like a schoolmarm whipping lazy pupils into order, she also refused to reveal any details of her plans. Though Geralt was not exactly charmed by this behavior, he knew he had to help her - for Ciri's sake._ Rewards: - None",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "id": "the-witcher-3-wild-hunt:kaer-morhen:558198:632",
      "name": "The Battle of Kaer Morhen",
      "slug": "558198",
      "typeSlug": "632",
      "iconSlug": "main_quest",
      "lat": 83.90482,
      "lng": -168.0134,
      "wikiPage": null,
      "checklistTaskId": 65197408,
      "mapgenieId": 558198,
      "regionId": null,
      "description": "Next | Previous Level: 24 _Geralt and Ciri had no choice but to teleport away from the Isle of Mists when the Wild Hunt threatened to attack. Since Eredin could trace where Ciri traveled to with her abilities, the duo did not so much flee the Hunt as buy a few precious minutes of time. Ciri took Geralt home, to Kaer Morhen, where the group of friends the witcher had gathered waited to defend Ciri to their last breath. They spared a few seconds for a tearful reunion - then began preparations to repel the Hunt's attack._ Rewards: - XP",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "id": "the-witcher-3-wild-hunt:kaer-morhen:558199:632",
      "name": "Blood on the Battlefield",
      "slug": "558199",
      "typeSlug": "632",
      "iconSlug": "main_quest",
      "lat": 83.904854,
      "lng": -168.0097,
      "wikiPage": null,
      "checklistTaskId": 65197409,
      "mapgenieId": 558199,
      "regionId": null,
      "description": "Next | Previous Level: 24 _Ciri's explosion of power had frightened everyone, her most of all. Clearly these uncontrolled outbursts could not be allowed to happen again, and so when the sorceresses departed for Novigrad to gather the Lodge, Ciri, Geralt and Avallac'h remained at Kaer Morhen for a few more days. The Sage hoped to teach Ciri a few tricks for controlling her power._ Rewards: - XP",
      "link": null
    },
