      "name": "Monster Slayer",
      "slug": "monster-slayer",
      "typeSlug": "633",
      "iconSlug": "secondary_quest",
      "lat": 83.915436,
      "lng": -168.0344,
      "wikiPage": null,
      "checklistTaskId": 64529691,
      "mapgenieId": 215877,
      "regionId": null,
      "description": "Guest Giver: Inspect the Drowner corpse Level: 26 _While walking along the shore of the lake near Kaer Morhen, Geralt came across the body of a drowner. The witcher thought at first that Lambert or Eskel had killed the creature - but upon closer inspection he soon discovered there were no marks dealt by sword or Sign. It was thus clear someone - or something - else had done the drowner in. They say the enemy of one's enemy is a friend, but Geralt wanted to see who exactly this downer-killing \"friend\" was._ Rewards: - 50xp - Cave Troll Liver",
      "link": null
    },
